    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into one of the most realistic roulette gambling simulations of all-time.\u00a0 Test your luck against the roulette wheel as you place your bets.\u00a0 \u00a0Roulette Simulator 2026 has been remastered with a massive graphics overhaul and an all-new gaming interface.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You now have the ability to place street bets, corner bets,\u00a0 in addition to all of the traditional bets that you can make on the roulette board.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additionally,\u00a0 gain experience and progress through a leveling system as you earn larger wins at the roulette table.\u00a0 Unlock Steam Achievements as you rank up and increase your bankroll.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NEW FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New Level-Up Ranking System</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New Bet Types (Corner Bets, Street Bets, and More!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improved Roulette Wheel and Ball Physics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overhauled Interface and Graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn  Steam Achievements!</p></li></ul>",
